    "created_at": "2021-01-28T09:36:13Z",
    "updated_at": "2021-01-28T09:37:11Z",
    "body": "I found starship on [freshports](https://www.freshports.org/shells/starship) and I have been using it on my BSD without issues:\r\n\r\n```atrodrig in atrodrig-tower in ~ \r\n❯ starship --version\r\nstarship 0.47.0\r\n\r\natrodrig in atrodrig-tower in ~ \r\n❯ uname -a\r\nFreeBSD atrodrig-tower 12.2-RELEASE-p1 FreeBSD 12.2-RELEASE-p1 GENERIC  amd64\r\n```\r\n\r\nMaybe this issue can be closed.",
    "author_association": "NONE",
    "pin": null,
